---
title: useCopyToClipboard
description: Copy text with the Clipboard API and keep temporary feedback in local Svelte state.
---

<p class="eyebrow">Svelte pattern</p>

# useCopyToClipboard

<CopyMarkdownButton url="/docs/hooks/use-copy-to-clipboard.md" />

The upstream React page provides a hook with copied state and a reset timeout. COSS for Svelte does
not export a `useCopyToClipboard` hook. Clipboard state belongs to the component that presents the
feedback, and Svelte's local state is enough for that job.

## Basic

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  let copied = $state(false);

  async function copy(value: string): Promise<void> {
    if (!value || !navigator.clipboard?.writeText) return;
    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(value);
    copied = true;
  }
</script>

<button type="button" onclick={() => copy("https://coss.com")}>
  {copied ? "Copied!" : "Copy"}
</button>
```

## Temporary feedback

Clear the existing timer before scheduling another copy confirmation. Dispose of the timer when the
component unmounts.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { onDestroy } from "svelte";

  const timeout = 2000;
  let copied = $state(false);
  let timer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | undefined;

  async function copy(value: string): Promise<void> {
    if (!value || !navigator.clipboard?.writeText) return;
    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(value);
    clearTimeout(timer);
    copied = true;
    timer = setTimeout(() => {
      copied = false;
      timer = undefined;
    }, timeout);
  }

  onDestroy(() => clearTimeout(timer));
</script>
```

Set no timer when the copied state should remain true until the component unmounts.

## Callback after a successful copy

Place the side effect after `writeText` resolves. A rejected clipboard request must not report a
successful copy.

```ts
await navigator.clipboard.writeText(value);
copied = true;
onCopy?.();
```

## With an icon swap

Use the shared SSR-safe renderer with Hugeicons data.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Copy01Icon, Tick01Icon } from "@hugeicons/core-free-icons";
  import { Button, HugeiconsIcon } from "@coss-sv/ui";
  import { onDestroy } from "svelte";

  let copied = $state(false);
  let timer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | undefined;

  async function copy(value: string): Promise<void> {
    if (!value || !navigator.clipboard?.writeText) return;
    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(value);
    clearTimeout(timer);
    copied = true;
    timer = setTimeout(() => {
      copied = false;
      timer = undefined;
    }, 2_000);
  }

  onDestroy(() => clearTimeout(timer));
</script>

<Button
  aria-label="Copy to clipboard"
  onclick={() => copy("https://coss.com")}
  size="icon"
  variant="outline"
>
  <HugeiconsIcon aria-hidden="true" icon={copied ? Tick01Icon : Copy01Icon} strokeWidth={2} />
</Button>
```

## Error handling

Clipboard access can fail when the page is not served from a secure context or the browser denies
permission. Catch the error when the interface needs to report that failure. Do not flip the copied
state until `writeText` resolves.
